  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3209.07 Credit for Unused Stickers.\n\n(a) Unused traditional colored backings and numerical monthly inserts shall be turned in to the department for a credit voucher.\n\n(b) Damaged traditional colored backings and numerical monthly inserts shall be returned to the department but no credit voucher shall be issued.\n\n(c) No credit shall be allowed for traditional colored backings older than the previous inspection period.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes at Chapter Heading Saf-C 3200) #8915, eff 6-22-07, EXPIRED: 6-22-15\n\nNew. #10886, INTERIM, eff 7-16-15, EXPIRES: 1-12-16; ss by #11016, eff 1-6-16",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c3200.html"
